{{Wireless adapter |brand=ZyXEL |model=NWD6505 |ean=4718937574216 |asin=B00D9F1SLI |newegg=N82E16833181299 |fcc_date=07/11/2013 |manuf_country=Taiwan |is_manuf=No |manuf=AboCom |manuf_model=NWD6505F |if=USB |if_bus_version=2.0 |if_connector_type=Male A |form_factor=dongle |vendor_id=0586 |device_id=3425 |fcc_id=I88NWD6505, MQ4NWD6505F |ic_id=2468C-NWD6505 |chip1_brand=MediaTek |chip1_model=MT7610U |accessible_UART=No |ant_conn=none |802dot11_protocols=abgn+ac |txchains=1 |rxchains=1 |sstreams=1 |oui=FC:F5:28 }} {{TagLine|Dual-Band Wireless AC600 USB Adapter}} :{{ProductPage|http://www.zyxel.com/products_services/nwd6505.shtml}}
"M01-D6505-D10" is silkscreened on the board in the FCC photos. :The FCC sample label has a MAC with a CC:5D:4E ('''[[ZyXEL]]''') OUI. The FCC ID of the parent product (MQ4NWD6505F, '''[[AboCom]]''' NWD6505F) :has also been assigned to this entry. This device is using [[MediaTek MT7610U]] (MT7610UN). :{{WiFiCert|WFA20064|06/21/2013}}
Per '''ZyXEL''''s driver, the USB ID for this device is '''0586:3425''' :The device description in the driver is <small>'''ZyXEL Dual-Band Wireless AC600 USB Adapter'''</small>.
Additional specifications, per '''ZyXEL''''s product page, follow... *Power consumption: 1.25 W *Item dimensions (W x D x H): [[Dimensions::58 mm x 21 mm x 11 mm]] *Item weight: [[Weight::8 g]]
